2. Limited evaluation permission

Without requesting separate permission, you may view this repository, download
the unmodified demo, build it, and run the included demo on your own machine
solely to try and technically evaluate the system. You may try only the MathSpecs
enabled by the included demo, with a maximum of four MathSpecs per demo run.
Running the included build checks and correctness selftests for that evaluation
is permitted; those checks do not authorize additional GPU workloads.

You may technically analyze and publish the results of this permitted evaluation
with attribution to ASTRO and a link to the source repository. Identify the demo
version and relevant test conditions, distinguish your measurements from ASTRO
claims, and do not imply endorsement by the copyright holder.

Source repository: https://github.com/ASTRO-Scientific-Compute/astro-compute

